---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base>
  <main>
    <h1 class="rise rise-1">Ashton Rowland</h1>
    <p class="role rise rise-2">Founder, Formenos Industries</p>

    <section class="section">
      <p class="rise rise-3">
        I grew up in Fairhope, Alabama, in a Marine family. I started building
        software as a teenager, mostly to solve my own problems. Most of my
        time goes to Formenos now.
      </p>
      <p class="rise rise-4">
        Outside of work I fish small mountain creeks in Colorado.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="rise rise-5">Currently</h2>
      <p class="rise rise-5">
        Formenos is an applied AI lab building biological intelligence. It's a
        learning system modeled on how real neurons compute, not on
        transformers. The first deployment is autonomous systems for denied
        environments. We're early. The work is mostly private.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="rise rise-6">Writing</h2>
      <p class="rise rise-6"><a href="/writing">Essays</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <a href="mailto:ashton@formenosindustries.com">ashton@formenosindustries.com</a>
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ashton-rowland-4353472a0/">LinkedIn</a>
